> often
> passed the > adj parameter to have the labels justified as I want, BUT once in
> while for > unknown reasons out of ten or more plots coming out of a function
> where I call
> > Bill Dunlaps function one or two plot will have one or two axis labels
> > completely off, when I say off I mean off, i.e. by one or two inches?  Any >
> clues?  "my.axis" if called from other functions, is there anything I should 
> do
> > to insure that all the par's setting remain the same between calls?
