I didn't receive any responces on how to create a something simular to a try { 
} catch (...) {} flow control sturcture in S, but I figured out a partial 
solution. Many errors can be caugt, by masking the stop function

stop.flag <- F

stop <- function( x) {
  cat( x, "\n")
  stop.flag <- T
}

for (i in 1:N) {
  dangerous.function( i)
  if (stop.flag==T) {
    stop.flag <- F
    # error handling code here, if any
    continue
  }

  # other code here, if any
}

HTH,

