Dear all,

Regarding my solution to the 'all possible combinations question'

The function dec2bin didn't do what it was supposed to do:

Here is the correct version:

dec2bin <- function(number, n)
{
        out <- rep(0,n)
        for (i in (n-1):0)
        {
                if (number >= 2^i) 
                        {
                                out[i+1] <- 1
                                number <- number-2^i
                        }
        }
out
}

Sorry about that

Bjarke

